{"seq":2,"slug":"free-camera","title":"自由相机控制：让手里的镜头像无人机一样听话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/camera/free-camera","wordCount":1487,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自由相机控制-让手里的镜头像无人机一样听话\">自由相机控制：让手里的镜头像无人机一样听话</h1><p>世界冻住、相机交到手里之后，玩家面对的第一感受就是「这镜头好不好开」。一台手感糟糕的自由相机——飘、顿、转起来晕——会让再美的世界也拍不出好照片。自由相机的工程目标，是把六个自由度的运动包装成一套直觉、平滑、可控速的操作手感。这一篇承接 <a href=\"pause-decoupling\">暂停与解耦</a> 交出的控制权，讲清楚这台相机如何移动、如何旋转、如何调速，以及手感从何而来；它产出的相机姿态会被 <a href=\"camera-constraints\">相机约束与碰撞</a> 加上限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-六自由度与控制模型\">核心概念：六自由度与控制模型</h2><p>自由相机是一个刚体，在三维空间里有六个自由度：沿三个轴平移（前后、左右、上下）和绕三个轴旋转（俯仰 pitch、偏航 yaw、翻滚 roll）。拍照相机几乎总是开放平移与俯仰、偏航，翻滚则按需开放（用于荷兰角构图）。下图给出输入到相机变换的处理链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始输入&lt;br/&gt;摇杆/鼠标键盘] --&gt; B[死区与曲线映射]&#10;  B --&gt; C[乘以当前移动速度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[转换到相机本地坐标系]&#10;  D --&gt; E[平滑/阻尼]&#10;  E --&gt; F[累加到相机位姿]&#10;  F --&gt; G[约束裁剪&lt;br/&gt;见约束篇]&#10;  G --&gt; H[更新视图矩阵]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始输入&lt;br/&gt;摇杆/鼠标键盘] --&gt; B[死区与曲线映射]\n  B --&gt; C[乘以当前移动速度]\n  C --&gt; D[转换到相机本地坐标系]\n  D --&gt; E[平滑/阻尼]\n  E --&gt; F[累加到相机位姿]\n  F --&gt; G[约束裁剪&lt;br/&gt;见约束篇]\n  G --&gt; H[更新视图矩阵]</pre><p>这条链里有两个手感关键节点：<strong>坐标系转换</strong>（D）决定「前」是相机朝向的前还是世界的前，<strong>平滑</strong>（E）决定运动是跟手还是飘。下面分别展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"移动-本地坐标系与速度分档\">移动：本地坐标系与速度分档</h2><p>直觉的自由相机，平移必须在<strong>相机本地坐标系</strong>里进行：玩家推「前」，相机应沿自己镜头朝向飞，而不是沿世界 Z 轴。实现上，把输入向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 用相机的旋转矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 变换到世界空间，再乘以速度与帧时间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_{t+1} = \\vec{p}_t + R \\cdot \\vec{v}_{in} \\cdot s \\cdot \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9223em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 要用<strong>未缩放时间</strong>，因为游戏的缩放时间在暂停态是 0，用它相机根本不会动——这是从 <a href=\"pause-decoupling\">暂停与解耦</a> 引出的直接后果，新手最常栽在这里。</p>\n<p>速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 必须可调，且跨度要大。玩家既要能贴着角色脸做微调（慢速），又要能飞到山顶俯瞰全景（快速）。下表是一种常见的速度分档设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>相对速度</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>微调</td>\n<td>0.1×</td>\n<td>贴近主体精修构图</td>\n<td>按住扳机减速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>一般取景移动</td>\n<td>默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速</td>\n<td>5×</td>\n<td>大范围转场</td>\n<td>按住扳机加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚轮微调</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>鼠标用户无级变速</td>\n<td>滚轮调节基准速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>很多游戏还会把速度与「离地高度」或「离主体距离」挂钩，让远处自动飞得快、近处自动变慢，进一步降低操作负担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旋转-俯仰偏航与可选翻滚\">旋转：俯仰偏航与可选翻滚</h2><p>旋转处理比平移微妙。俯仰（抬头低头）需要在接近正上方/正下方时<strong>夹紧</strong>，否则越过天顶会发生万向锁式的视角翻转，把玩家转晕。通常把 pitch 限制在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>89</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>89</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-89°, +89°]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">89°</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">89°</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。偏航（左右转头）一般无需限制，可自由旋转 360°。</p>\n<p>翻滚（roll，镜头左右倾斜）是拍照相机特有的奢侈品。游玩相机几乎从不开放 roll，因为它会引发眩晕——这正是相机系统 hub 反复强调的舒适度问题，见 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/craft-practice/motion-sickness-comfort\">眩晕与舒适度</a>。但在拍照模式里世界静止、玩家主动操作，roll 反而成了制造「荷兰角」张力的构图利器，因此通常作为一个独立可调项开放，并提供「一键回正」防止玩家把地平线调歪后找不回来。</p>\n<p>旋转还要处理输入设备差异：鼠标是相对位移（delta），摇杆是绝对偏移（持续推动持续转）。两者要分别处理灵敏度，且都需要可调，因为这是个人偏好极强的参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手感-平滑-死区与跟手的平衡\">手感：平滑、死区与跟手的平衡</h2><p>让自由相机「跟手又不飘」，靠的是对原始输入的几道加工，每一道都在「响应」与「平滑」之间做权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>死区（dead zone）</strong>：摇杆静止时常有微小漂移，必须设死区把小于阈值的输入归零，否则相机会自己慢慢移动，毁掉静止构图。</li>\n<li><strong>输入曲线</strong>：把线性输入映射成幂曲线（如平方），让小幅推动对应精细微调、大幅推动对应快速移动，兼顾精度与效率。</li>\n<li><strong>阻尼平滑</strong>：对目标速度做指数平滑或临界阻尼，消除起步和停止时的突兀。但平滑过度会「飘」——玩家松手后相机还在滑行。一个常用模型是指数趋近：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{t+1} = v_t + (v_{target} - v_t)\\,(1 - e^{-k\\,\\Delta t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越跟手、越小越顺滑。拍照相机的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 通常比游玩相机略大，因为玩家此刻追求的是精确控制而非影院级顺滑。这套阻尼数学与游玩相机的跟随阻尼同源，差别只在调参方向，底层原理见 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/foundations/camera-follow-damping\">相机跟随与阻尼</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自由相机是六自由度刚体，拍照场景默认开放平移、俯仰、偏航，按需开放翻滚。</li>\n<li>平移要在相机本地坐标系进行，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 必须用未缩放时间，否则暂停态下相机不动。</li>\n<li>速度要大跨度可调（微调到快速），常与离地高度或离主体距离联动以减负。</li>\n<li>俯仰需夹紧防翻转，翻滚是拍照特有的构图利器但要配一键回正，鼠标与摇杆灵敏度分别可调。</li>\n<li>手感来自死区、输入曲线、阻尼平滑三道加工；拍照相机阻尼系数偏大以求精确而非顺滑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"pause-decoupling\">暂停与解耦</a>（为何要用未缩放时间）、<a href=\"camera-constraints\">相机约束与碰撞</a>（给自由相机加限制）、<a href=\"../tools/composition-tools\">构图工具 (景深/视场)</a>（视场角也是相机参数）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：阻尼数学与翻滚眩晕，见相机系统 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/foundations/camera-follow-damping\">相机跟随与阻尼</a> 与 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/craft-practice/motion-sickness-comfort\">眩晕与舒适度</a>；输入设备差异的处理见 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/framing-control/input-control-schemes\">输入控制方案</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自由相机控制：让手里的镜头像无人机一样听话","id":"自由相机控制-让手里的镜头像无人机一样听话"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：六自由度与控制模型","id":"核心概念-六自由度与控制模型"},{"level":2,"text":"移动：本地坐标系与速度分档","id":"移动-本地坐标系与速度分档"},{"level":2,"text":"旋转：俯仰偏航与可选翻滚","id":"旋转-俯仰偏航与可选翻滚"},{"level":2,"text":"手感：平滑、死区与跟手的平衡","id":"手感-平滑-死区与跟手的平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"暂停与解耦：把世界冻住，把相机交出去","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/camera/pause-decoupling"},"next":{"title":"相机约束与碰撞：给自由不是给放纵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/camera/camera-constraints"}}